@startuml
!include ../theme.puml
title 工具权限：L1请求PDP，执行点消费与启动
participant "L2 Runtime" as Runtime
participant "L1业务Activity / PEP" as Control
participant "PDP" as PDP
participant "ApprovalBridge" as Bridge
participant "外部审批" as Approval
participant "Permit / 安全存储" as Permit
participant "L3 ToolCall / Guard" as Tool
participant "L4 Provider / Sandbox" as Provider
Runtime -> Control : ToolCallCandidate
Control -> Control : 固定提案；提交权限命令
Control -> PDP : PermissionDecisionPort.decide
alt Ask
 PDP -> Bridge : 同安全事务创建pending / outbox
 PDP --> Control : Ask + approvalRef（审计已确认）
 Control -> Control : 持久等待，Yield并释放槽
 Bridge -> Approval : ApprovalRequestPort.submit
 Approval -> Bridge : 认证回调
 Bridge -> Bridge : 绑定/截止/取消检查，CAS批准事实
 Bridge --> Control : 事实通知；不是Permit
 Control -> PDP : 新权限命令decide（同Proposal）
end
alt 最终Allow
 PDP -> Permit : T-D签发短时Permit + 必要审计
 PDP --> Control : Allow + permitRef
 Control -> Control : 耐久派发意图
 Control -> Tool : ToolRuntimePort.dispatch（已授权动作）
 Tool -> Tool : 唯一受理；实际参数/目标复核
 Tool -> Permit : consume + 必要审计
 Permit --> Tool : 原子消费Receipt
 Tool -> Tool : AUTHORIZED
 Tool -> Permit : authorizeStart（当前claim / epoch / 截止）
 Permit --> Tool : Grant（必要审计已确认）
 Tool -> Tool : STARTED CAS；唯一胜者
 Tool -> Provider : 固定ExecutionPlan，执行一次
 Provider --> Tool : 可信结果或未知
 Tool -> Tool : 结果/UNKNOWN + outbox耐久化
 Tool --> Control : 原command观察事实
else Deny / unavailable
 PDP --> Control : 稳定拒绝或依赖失败
 Control -> Control : 业务结果持久化；执行0
end
note over Tool,Provider
 STARTED之后未知只查询，不自动重执行。
 撤销先于authorizeStart则不启动；之后为在途取消。
end note
@enduml
